  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer dielectric multilayer coating on CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence from air side: SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat) (cavity 1), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si (cavity 2), SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, SiO2 (Kischkat), Si, terminating on CaF2 (Daimon-20). All 22 layer thicknesses are optimizable variables. Wavelength range 2500-5000 nm. Target high transmittance at 3250-3350 nm and 4200-4300 nm. Target low transmittance at 2500-3100 nm and 4450-5000 nm. No metal layers. Unpolarized light at 0 degree incidence.",
